        "revision": 1355581012,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "Albizia ferruginea is sometimes cultivated as an ornamental and shade tree.\nWood is used in carpentry work and also in construction.\nThe timber provides high chatoyance, with an average value above 20 PZC.",
